{"id":"vod_zy360_67569","vodId":"67569","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"哥特萝莉侦探事件簿","name_cn":"哥特萝莉侦探事件簿","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"国产动漫","remarks":"全24集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241103-1/b55d123f46df4c6e6f6e776d85b2fdfb.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在1924年的圣瓦尔贵族子弟寄宿学校玛格丽特学院，转学生久城一弥（江口拓也配音）刚刚来到学校，就因外表而被称为不详的“黑色死神”。实际上，一弥是个老实又木讷的男孩，可正是这样的性格使他总是轻易的会被卷入难以用常理来解释的怪奇事件中。在一次杀人事件中，一弥遇见了身材娇小一头金发的少女维多利加（悠木碧配音），这个谜一样的少女以其高超的智商帮助一弥脱出了险境，两人的羁绊也从此开始了。在这个校园里，流传着许许多多耸人听闻的灵异事件，而在这些事件的背后，作祟的究竟是鬼怪还是人类，这个问题的答案就要交给一弥和维多利加去一一破解了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-11-03 21:07:19","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/PbtmI0lT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/lQyqTDwN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/fIXN8nIb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/SUlsCNdG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/zMgXJ0QI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/1ZgrpARd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/0kKw3kF7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/8Yg6i9PZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/b5tmzkeM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/bbb0g7R4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/IUClEcYj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/x9FbbKcH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/l4wmMfhl/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/bbx2AZcP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/CDX7y4ss/index.m3u8"},